ed part of the claim (the formula for the age-specific force of selection) is not tested; only the biological corollary that mortality must rise with adult age. Class Aves (8 species) is held out and scorable later with 'analysis.py --exam'; the first run of the script, before the gate was added, printed the birds' fraction rising once and it was not used.
